# The upstream files of the vendored ASA keep upstream's CRLF line endings,
# in which the TADAH-PATCH hunks of asa.c are written
# (external/asa/TADAH-PATCHES.md): git converts none of their line endings,
# whatever core.autocrlf or a global attributes file asks for; diffs stay
# textual. Checked by hpo_vendored_asa_line_endings and
# hpo_vendored_asa_gitattributes (tests/check_vendored_asa.py).
external/asa/asa.c          -text
external/asa/asa.h          -text
external/asa/asa_usr_asa.h  -text
external/asa/ASA-LICENSE    -text
external/asa/ASA-NOTES      -text
external/asa/ASA-README.txt -text
